<title>UK: Credit Local adds 500 mln Ffr to 5-yr bond. [CORRECTED 09:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Credit Local adds 500 mln Ffr to 5-yr bond. [CORRECTED 09:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 2.5 billion French francs from 2.0 billion French francs, joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Banque Nationale de Paris said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT ** 2.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.375     MATURITY    11.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.185   PAY DATE    11.OCT.96</p>
<p>(Corrects issue price from 102.184.)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    100.56    SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** LAUNCHED ON 25.SEP.96 FOR 2.0 BLN FFR AT 101.565</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    PARIS/LUX PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BTAN DUE OCT 2001</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
